  "accounting_assessment": [
    "Statement owners and substantive proof branches are disjoint leaves. Named theorem aggregates contain sets of owner IDs and are expressly not additional charges. Dependency closures take unions of those IDs before summing.",
    "Every introduction, definition, retained statement, auxiliary discussion, source correction, reference and code-wrapper character remains in the authoritative full-document totals. Unused or ancillary text is not silently removed because it does not enter a selected result closure.",
